{
    "title": "Telemundo Houston: Noticias",
    "description": "Telemundo Houston's redesigned news and weather app connects you to the best local content, alerts and the most accurate weather forecasts, breaking news, live TV, and investigative journalism.\r\n\r\nTHE AUTHORITY ON TIME FOR HOUSTON\r\n\r\n+ Customizable weather home screen with weather modules that you can rearrange\r\n+ Improved location center to add new locations and set weather alerts\r\n+ Exclusive real-time radar\r\n+ 10-day forecast for Houston and Texas\r\n+ Hourly forecasts with customizable graphs \r\n+ Detailed forecast information including UV index and dew point \r\n+ Weather alerts for your area\r\n+ Information about school closures due to bad weather in Harris and Wharton County\r\n\r\n\r\nTEXAS LIVE NEWS AND VIDEO ALERTS\r\n\r\n+ Personalized alerts for local news from Houston, McAllen, Dallas and national news from the US-Mexico border\r\n+ Breaking news section showing articles in reverse chronological order \r\n+ Alert center showing news and trends affecting our community, including immigration news \r\n+ Watch live Telemundo Houston newscasts and other streaming content\r\n+ Specific video, all-access and sports section featuring coverage of the Houston Rockets, Houston Astros and World Cup content \r\n\r\nTELEMUNDO INVESTIGATIONS RESPONSE AND MORE \r\n\r\n+ Telemundo Houston Investiga's award-winning reporting\r\n+ Telemundo Houston Responde solve your problems as a consumer and fight to get your money back\r\n+ CNBC Financial News\r\n+ Local and national news from NBCU Local\r\n\r\nTelemundo Houston's news and weather app includes proprietary Nielsen measurement software that will allow you to contribute to market research, such as Nielsen's TV Ratings. Please visit www.nielsen.com/digitalprivacy for more information. \r\n\r\nYour privacy options: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/notrtoo-spanish?brandA=Owned_Stations&intake=Telemundo_Houston             \r\nCalifornia Notice: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy-policy/aviso-de-california?intake=Telemundo_Houston                \r\n\r\n\r\nTelemundo Houston's redesigned news and weather app connects you to the top local content, the most accurate weather forecasts, breaking news alerts, live TV, and investigative journalism. \r\n\r\nTHE WEATHER AUTHORITY FOR HOUSTON\r\n\r\n+ Exclusive real-time radar\r\n+ 10-day forecast for Houston and Texas\r\n+ Hourly forecasts with customizable graphics \r\n+ Detailed forecast information including UV index and dew point \r\n+ Weather alerts for your area\r\n+ Weather closings information for Harris County and Wharton County\r\n\r\n\r\nTEXAS LIVE NEWS ALERTS AND VIDEO\r\n\r\n+ Customized alerts for local news from Houston, McAllen, Dallas and national news from the U.S.-Mexico border\r\n+ Breaking news section displaying articles in reverse chronological order \r\n+ Alert center that displays news and trends affecting our community, including breaking immigration news \r\n+ Watch Telemundo Houston's live newscasts and other streaming content\r\n+ Specific video, full access and sports section featuring coverage of the Houston Rockets, Houston Astros and World Cup content \r\n\r\nTELEMUNDO RESPONDS INVESTIGATIONS AND MORE \r\n\r\n+ Award-winning reporting from Telemundo Houston Investiga\r\n+ Telemundo Houston Responde solves your consumer problems and fights for your money back.\r\n+ Business news from CNBC\r\n+ Local and national news from NBCU Local\r\n\r\n\r\nTelemundo Houston's news and weather app includes Nielsen's proprietary measurement software that allows you to contribute to market research, such as the Nielsen TV Ratings. Please visit www.nielsen.com/digitalprivacy for more information.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Telemundo Houston&#39;s redesigned news and weather app connects you to the best local content, alerts and the most accurate weather forecasts, breaking news, live TV, and investigative journalism.<br><br>THE AUTHORITY ON TIME FOR HOUSTON<br><br>+ Customizable weather home screen with weather modules that you can rearrange<br>+ Improved location center to add new locations and set weather alerts<br>+ Exclusive real-time radar<br>+ 10-day forecast for Houston and Texas<br>+ Hourly forecasts with customizable graphs <br>+ Detailed forecast information including UV index and dew point <br>+ Weather alerts for your area<br>+ Information about school closures due to bad weather in Harris and Wharton County<br><br><br>TEXAS LIVE NEWS AND VIDEO ALERTS<br><br>+ Personalized alerts for local news from Houston, McAllen, Dallas and national news from the US-Mexico border<br>+ Breaking news section showing articles in reverse chronological order <br>+ Alert center showing news and trends affecting our community, including immigration news <br>+ Watch live Telemundo Houston newscasts and other streaming content<br>+ Specific video, all-access and sports section featuring coverage of the Houston Rockets, Houston Astros and World Cup content <br><br>TELEMUNDO INVESTIGATIONS RESPONSE AND MORE <br><br>+ Telemundo Houston Investiga&#39;s award-winning reporting<br>+ Telemundo Houston Responde solve your problems as a consumer and fight to get your money back<br>+ CNBC Financial News<br>+ Local and national news from NBCU Local<br><br>Telemundo Houston&#39;s news and weather app includes proprietary Nielsen measurement software that will allow you to contribute to market research, such as Nielsen&#39;s TV Ratings. Please visit www.nielsen.com/digitalprivacy for more information. <br><br>Your privacy options: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/notrtoo-spanish?brandA=Owned_Stations&amp;intake=Telemundo_Houston             <br>California Notice: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy-policy/aviso-de-california?intake=Telemundo_Houston                <br><br><br>Telemundo Houston&#39;s redesigned news and weather app connects you to the top local content, the most accurate weather forecasts, breaking news alerts, live TV, and investigative journalism. <br><br>THE WEATHER AUTHORITY FOR HOUSTON<br><br>+ Exclusive real-time radar<br>+ 10-day forecast for Houston and Texas<br>+ Hourly forecasts with customizable graphics <br>+ Detailed forecast information including UV index and dew point <br>+ Weather alerts for your area<br>+ Weather closings information for Harris County and Wharton County<br><br><br>TEXAS LIVE NEWS ALERTS AND VIDEO<br><br>+ Customized alerts for local news from Houston, McAllen, Dallas and national news from the U.S.-Mexico border<br>+ Breaking news section displaying articles in reverse chronological order <br>+ Alert center that displays news and trends affecting our community, including breaking immigration news <br>+ Watch Telemundo Houston&#39;s live newscasts and other streaming content<br>+ Specific video, full access and sports section featuring coverage of the Houston Rockets, Houston Astros and World Cup content <br><br>TELEMUNDO RESPONDS INVESTIGATIONS AND MORE <br><br>+ Award-winning reporting from Telemundo Houston Investiga<br>+ Telemundo Houston Responde solves your consumer problems and fights for your money back.<br>+ Business news from CNBC<br>+ Local and national news from NBCU Local<br><br><br>Telemundo Houston&#39;s news and weather app includes Nielsen&#39;s proprietary measurement software that allows you to contribute to market research, such as the Nielsen TV Ratings. Please visit www.nielsen.com/digitalprivacy for more information.",
